1
00:00:00,364 --> 00:00:02,244
(Leonard:)Sandwich shop.

2
00:00:03,408 --> 00:00:05,658
(Leonard:)Doesn't that violate
the health code or...?

3
00:00:06,119 --> 00:00:08,209
(Penny:)No, at the sub shop,
we were only making out.

4
00:00:08,538 --> 00:00:10,288
Ah, okay.

5
00:00:10,457 --> 00:00:14,917
(Leonard:)But my point is that you have absolutely
no reason to be embarrassed.

6
00:00:15,837 --> 00:00:18,297
Really? Do you think I overreacted?

7
00:00:18,465 --> 00:00:21,465
- Maybe a little.
- Because I do that, I do overreact.

8
00:00:21,635 --> 00:00:24,015
- Maybe I should call Mike and apologize.
- No, no.

9
00:00:24,179 --> 00:00:26,719
No, that would be under-reacting.

10
00:00:27,641 --> 00:00:30,481
(Leonard:)He did break the implied confidentiality
of the bedroom...

11
00:00:30,644 --> 00:00:34,854
(Leonard:)...and in your case, the elevator,
parks and fast-food franchise.

12
00:00:35,023 --> 00:00:36,563
(Penny:)Yes, you're right.

13
00:00:36,733 --> 00:00:38,863
I should just say I am done with him.

14
00:00:39,027 --> 00:00:40,817
(Leonard:)Yes you should. Go ahead, say it.

15
00:00:41,446 --> 00:00:44,076
(Penny:)But I never gave the man a chance
to explain.

16
00:00:44,783 --> 00:00:47,243
What is there to explain?
It's all right here.

17
00:00:47,411 --> 00:00:49,371
It's betrayal.

18
00:00:49,538 --> 00:00:51,788
(Penny:)No, you were right the first time.

19
00:00:51,957 --> 00:00:53,787
(Penny:)This is a man who loves me...

20
00:00:53,959 --> 00:00:59,019
...but in his own stupid way was just trying
to show people how he feels.

